Unsorted, unpriorized, incomplete list of things we have to be done:

- Album management
    - delete albums when no image is part of it anymore (audio albums,
      genres and artists too: their totals go to 0, the entries stay)
    - create preview thumbnail for the album (GenerateAlbumThumbnailsCommand
      does nothing yet)

- Image management
    - extract exif information from images (createdTime is when the file was
      first found, not when the picture was taken)

- Service
    - run as a user of its own rather than root: it parses every file in
      /media/internal with TagLib and Qt
    - handle IN_Q_OVERFLOW (the kernel's event queue ran over) with a rescan;
      until then changes in such a burst are only picked up at the next start
    - delete the thumbnails of images that are removed (only those removed
      while their thumbnail was being made go now)
